  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "When you use Rock paper tuition, we may ask you to provide your personal
    data to us. For transparency purposes, we explain in detail what personal data
    we collect and have access to, the purposes for which we use them, and legal
    bases on which we rely when processing your personal data. We comply with data
    minimisation principles. This means that we collect only a minimal amount of
    personal data that is necessary for your use of Rock paper tuition. We use your
    personal data for limited, specified and legitimate purposes explicitly mentioned
    in this Privacy Policy. We do not repurpose your personal data. This means that
    we do not use it for any purposes that are different from the purposes for which
    your personal data was provided. Below, you can find an overview of the types
    of personal data that we collect, the purposes for which we use it, and the legal
    bases on which we rely when processing it.\r\nWe collect both personal and non-personal
    data to improve user experience and app functionality.\r\n\r\n\r\nPersonal Data\r\nWe
    collect the following information during account registration or login:\r\nFull
    Name\r\nEmail Address\r\nPhone Number\r\nAge\r\n\r\nAddress\r\n\r\n\r\nThese
    details help us:\r\n\r\nCreate user accounts and profiles\r\n\r\nTrack user progress
    and personalize learning\r\n\r\nProvide customer support and account recovery\r\n\r\nSend
    notifications related to the App\r\n\r\n\r\nNon-Personal Data\r\nWe automatically
    collect non-personal data to improve app performance, including:\r\nDevice Information
    (OS, device model, screen resolution)\r\nApp Usage Data (Levels played, time
    spent, scores, progress)\r\nInteractions & Click Patterns (Game performance,
    user activity)\r\nIP Address (For security and fraud prevention)\r\n\r\nThis
    data helps us enhance the app, fix bugs, and optimize content.\r\n\r\n\r\nChildren's
    Data & Parental Consent\r\nSince our app is designed for children, we take measures
    to ensure the privacy and security of their data. We do not knowingly collect
    personal data from children under 13 without parental consent. Parents can review,
    modify, or delete their child\u2019s data by contacting us at info@rextechstudios.com.\r\n\r\nAnalytics
    data\r\n When you use the Apps downloaded from Google Play Store, we use our
    third-party analytics service providers, including Firebase (https://firebase.google.com)
    offered by Google, Google Analytics, and AppsFlyer, which automatically collect
    the following technical personal and non-personal data from you:\r\n\r\nIP address;\r\n\r\nNumber
    of sessions;\r\n\r\nSession duration;\r\n\r\nRetention;\r\n\r\nEvents;\r\n\r\nInstall
    source; and\r\n\r\nIDFA.\r\n\r\nWe use such data to:\r\n\r\nAnalyse the technical
    aspects of your use of the Apps;\r\n\r\nOptimise the Apps for your needs;\r\n\r\nPrevent
    fraud and abuse of the Apps;\r\n\r\nEnsure the security of the Apps; and\r\n\r\nServe
    you relevant ads.\r\n\r\nWe keep such data as long as it is necessary for its
    purposes, but no longer than 1 year. The legal bases that we rely on when processing
    the above-mentioned data are \u201Cpursuing our legitimate business interests\u201D
    (i.e., to analyse, grow, and protect KLA) and \u201Cyour consent\u201D."
